      "settings": {
        "eyebrow_text": "The problem it solves",
        "heading": "<p>Strike is hard to feel. TRACE ONE makes it visible.</p>",
        "copy": "<p>If you’ve ever thought you flushed it and still hit it thin or fat, this is usually why. TRACE ONE leaves a mark so you can see contact and low point — then adjust on the next swing.</p>",
        "ritual_heading": "A simple 5-minute drill",
        "note": "Go slow. You’re training strike, not speed.",
        "panel_eyebrow": "Quick read",
        "panel_title": "Push the mark to center.",
